{
    printf("Enter number: ");
    scanf("%d", &value);
    sum += value;
    if(value == 0)break;
}

```

Also, rather then using `while (1)` with a `break` condition at the end, use a `do..while` loop.

```
sum = 0;
do {
    printf("Enter number: ");
    scanf("%d", &value);
    sum += value;
} while (value != 0);

```

